    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/907d26fc30bdafa942583d48abfa464f.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/907d26fc30bdafa942583d48abfa464f.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/907d26fc30bdafa942583d48abfa464f.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose from 9 unique weapons to smash the competition on retro inspired Death-Match<br>levels. Each weapon has unique abilities and play styles to master. Brawl it out free for all<br>or team up to take out your enemies and loot all their gold!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/64ade5305c8645729603ab4f5c822b5c.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/64ade5305c8645729603ab4f5c822b5c.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/64ade5305c8645729603ab4f5c822b5c.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore more of the castle with tons of freakishly fun Mini-Game rounds that earn you more<br>gold and a shiny new target on your back for the next round. . .<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/c0c1d120e23b77caf2d96e5a39cfb81e.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/c0c1d120e23b77caf2d96e5a39cfb81e.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/c0c1d120e23b77caf2d96e5a39cfb81e.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Now it's time to spend all that gold you've been earning to upgrade your loadout and slug it <br>out again with your newfound POWER!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/597e1def1bfd3dbe3e0fce0cf4e768d1.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/597e1def1bfd3dbe3e0fce0cf4e768d1.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/597e1def1bfd3dbe3e0fce0cf4e768d1.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enter the Throne Room and see who earned the most medals, caused the most carnage, and <br>just all around crushed it in general. If you take home the gold you'll earn a larger amount of <br>Castle Coins to spend on cosmetic unlocks.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/8621c1799e4c47002717e4c0da8e663c.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/8621c1799e4c47002717e4c0da8e663c.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/8621c1799e4c47002717e4c0da8e663c.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Remember those Castle Coins we told you about? You can use those to unlock more crazy<br>characters and wicked weapons to add to your arsenal. There are even some super secret<br>unlocks that you'll have to use the ol' noggin to figure out.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/907d26fc30bdafa942583d48abfa464f.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/907d26fc30bdafa942583d48abfa464f.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/907d26fc30bdafa942583d48abfa464f.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose from 9 unique weapons to smash the competition on retro inspired Death-Match<br>levels. Each weapon has unique abilities and play styles to master. Brawl it out free for all<br>or team up to take out your enemies and loot all their gold!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/64ade5305c8645729603ab4f5c822b5c.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/64ade5305c8645729603ab4f5c822b5c.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/64ade5305c8645729603ab4f5c822b5c.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore more of the castle with tons of freakishly fun Mini-Game rounds that earn you more<br>gold and a shiny new target on your back for the next round. . .<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/c0c1d120e23b77caf2d96e5a39cfb81e.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/c0c1d120e23b77caf2d96e5a39cfb81e.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/c0c1d120e23b77caf2d96e5a39cfb81e.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Now it's time to spend all that gold you've been earning to upgrade your loadout and slug it <br>out again with your newfound POWER!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/597e1def1bfd3dbe3e0fce0cf4e768d1.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/597e1def1bfd3dbe3e0fce0cf4e768d1.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/597e1def1bfd3dbe3e0fce0cf4e768d1.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enter the Throne Room and see who earned the most medals, caused the most carnage, and <br>just all around crushed it in general. If you take home the gold you'll earn a larger amount of <br>Castle Coins to spend on cosmetic unlocks.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/8621c1799e4c47002717e4c0da8e663c.poster.avif?t=1725729392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/8621c1799e4c47002717e4c0da8e663c.webm?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608940/extras/8621c1799e4c47002717e4c0da8e663c.mp4?t=1725729392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Remember those Castle Coins we told you about? You can use those to unlock more crazy<br>characters and wicked weapons to add to your arsenal. There are even some super secret<br>unlocks that you'll have to use the ol' noggin to figure out.",
